    "body": "Made one more change: 7932bad takes the non-normative text about the `storage` event and marks it up with a subdfn for “send a storage notification” so that the existing hyperlinked references to that will also be hyperlinked in the dev edition.\r\n\r\nTo enable that to work, also added additional w-nohtml wording at the reference points, to make the statements informative rather than normative: In the dev edition they become _“**user agents** send a storage notification”_ (statement of fact) rather than just _“send a storage notification”_ (imperative).",
